    // MARK: - WEEKLY UX IMPROVEMENT — Scenario Planned Weekly Spending section
    //
    // Root cause this section fixes: `weeklyComparisonSection` in MonthlyPlanScenarioView.swift
    // always rendered the full week-by-week card list, and each card's own
    // `ScenarioSummaryText.isDiscretionarySpendingUnavailable` check could independently show "No
    // Weekly Spending Available" regardless of `hasActiveScenario` — a message about an exhausted
    // Scenario budget appearing when there was no Scenario at all. Presentation-only fix, verified
    // via source-scan against the exact code structure (the established pattern for SwiftUI-only
    // behavior throughout this file — private view builders can't be unit-tested directly).

    private static func scenarioViewSource() throws -> String {
