    // MARK: - HERO CARD LAYOUT CORRECTION
    //
    // The three planning formulas (Effective Planned Weekly Spending, Projected Available After
    // Spend, Projected Monthly Savings) were already correct as of the prior WEEKLY SPENDING
    // UNIFICATION phase — confirmed by direct source inspection before any edit was made. This
    // phase is a pure MonthlyPlanHeroCard.swift layout correction (two-column top row + a second
    // row below the left column, replacing the prior single three-column HStack that forced
    // "Projected Available After Spend" to truncate/scale down). Formula tests below reconfirm
    // the untouched formulas against this task's own three worked examples; layout tests are
    // source-scan, matching this codebase's established convention for SwiftUI-only structure.

