    // MARK: - URGENT REGRESSION FIX — restore Dashboard/Weekly Budget cards in Automatic mode
    //
    // `nil` (`plannedWeeklySpendingOverride == nil`) means Automatic mode, never "Unconfigured."
    // The Dashboard "This Week" card and the Weekly Budget hero card previously hid behind a
    // "Set Weekly Budget" empty-state prompt whenever their locally-derived `weeklyLimit` was not
    // `> 0` — collapsing three genuinely distinct states (never configured, Automatic mode, a
    // deliberate custom $0.00) into one. Both cards must now always render the normal progress
    // card, in both Automatic and Custom mode, even a genuine custom $0.00.

    // -- Automatic semantics (nil is Automatic, not Unconfigured) --

